Parameter|Value|Group|Details
###
### CHECO26 基线（2026-08-10）
### 依据：N-SDM 官方 settings.psv 全参数 + species_prep/docs/species_dataprep_plan.md 第六节
### 单层口径：按 DATAPREP.md "Single level usage" 全部数据置于 glo，n_levels=1
### 激活数据集：alltaxa_geom（GBIF 全类群 v2 空间优先）；切换数据集时同步改 mask_pred_glo
###
### General Environment（HPC 部署时按集群实况填写路径）
###
new_sess|TRUE|General Environment|Indicates whether this run is treated as a new N-SDM session.
exit_any|TRUE|General Environment|Exiting N-SDM on any error.
w_path||General Environment|Path to the working directory. 待 HPC 部署时填。
svp_path||General Environment|Path where final outputs are transferred and stored permanently. 待部署时填。
data_path||General Environment|Path to the input data directory. 指向 CHECO26/N-SDM/data（留空则用默认）。
rsync_exclude|d1_covsels,d2_models,d6_preds,d12_preds-sce|General Environment|Output folders excluded when transferring results to svp_path.
scr_path||General Environment|Path to the scratch directory for temporary storage. 待部署时填。
clear_scr|TRUE|General Environment|If TRUE, clears the scratch directory before starting.
clear_fst|FALSE|General Environment|If TRUE, delete previously converted fst files (covariate and species data).
module_r|r|General Environment|Name and version of the R module to be loaded on the cluster.
module_others||General Environment|Comma-separated list of additional modules required to load R.
Rlib_path||General Environment|Path to the R libraries. 待部署时填。
seed|12345|General Environment|Seed value used in R scripts.
###
### Species Data（CHECO26 基线：min_occ=30 主分析，thin_dist=1000 m 对齐 1 km 分辨率）
###
n_mx_spe|3|Species Data|Maximum number of species processed simultaneously.
forced_species|forced.psv|Species Data|(Optional) Name of the .psv file listing species to be used for the run.
glo_use_reg|TRUE|Species Data|If TRUE, regional species data are also included in the global model.
pa_po_reg|po|Species Data|Specifies whether regional species data are presence-only (po) or presence-absence (pa).
pa_po_glo|po|Species Data|Specifies whether global species data are presence-only (po) or presence-absence (pa).
min_occ_reg|50|Species Data|Minimum number of occurrences required for a species at the regional level.
min_occ_glo|30|Species Data|CHECO26 主分析基线（敏感性档位 10 / 50，同一 psv 改参复跑）。
disag_reg|TRUE|Species Data|If TRUE, applies spatial and/or temporal disaggregation to regional occurrences.
disag_glo|TRUE|Species Data|If TRUE, applies spatial and/or temporal disaggregation to global occurrences.
thin_dist_reg|200|Species Data|Distance threshold for spatial thinning of regional occurrences (level units).
thin_time_reg|5|Species Data|Minimum temporal distance (in years) between retained presences for regional data.
thin_dist_glo|1000|Species Data|CHECO26：米（China_Albers 米制 CRS），对齐 1 km 建模分辨率。
thin_time_glo|5|Species Data|CHECO26：次轮 tmatch_glo=TRUE 时生效；首轮 tmatch=FALSE 仅按空间抽稀。
back_strat|random|Species Data|首轮基线用 random，后续对比 random_w（见 species_dataprep_plan.md）。
n_back|10000|Species Data|Number of background points to generate.
###
### Covariate Data and Selection
###
cov_observ||Covariate Data and Selection|List of observational covariates. 待 expert table 议题定案后填。
cov_observ_val|median|Covariate Data and Selection|If any cov_observ. How observational covariate values are fixed.
tmatch_glo|FALSE|Covariate Data and Selection|首跑 FALSE（鱼类与全类群首轮均不做时间匹配），次轮再启用。
tmatch_reg|TRUE|Covariate Data and Selection|If TRUE, applies temporal matching in regional models.
tmatch_scheme_glo|npts|Covariate Data and Selection|Scheme for temporal matching ('npts' or 'nts').
tmatch_scheme_reg|npts|Covariate Data and Selection|Scheme for temporal matching ('npts' or 'nts').
cor_cut|0.7|Covariate Data and Selection|Threshold for Pearson correlation coefficient to filter colinear covariates.
max_thre|12|Covariate Data and Selection|Maximum possible number of covariates allowed in a model.
expert_table|expert_table.psv|Covariate Data and Selection|(Optional) Pre-filtering table listing allowed covariates per species group. 待建。
###
### Modelling Algorithms and Validation
###
mod_algo|glm,gam,max,rf,gbm|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|List of algorithms to run.
param_grid|param_grid.psv|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|Hyperparameter tuning grid file in ./scripts/settings.
reps|5|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|Number of cross-validation replicates.
use_spatial_stratification|FALSE|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|If TRUE, uses spatial clustering for training/testing splits.
use_random_global|TRUE|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|If use_spatial_stratification is TRUE, global splits still drawn randomly.
eval_crit|maxTSS|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|Metric used for thresholding predictions.
best_met|Score|Modelling Algorithms and Validation|Metric used to select best models.
###
### ESM-Specific Parameters
###
ncov_esm|5|ESM-Specific Parameters|Maximum total number of covariates evaluated in the ESM framework.
comb_esm|2|ESM-Specific Parameters|Number of covariates combined in each ESM model.
best_thre_esm|0.5|ESM-Specific Parameters|Threshold for retaining ESM models.
###
### Ensembling
###
do_weighting|FALSE|Ensembling|If TRUE, algorithms are weighted in ensembles based on a chosen metric.
weight_metric|Score|Ensembling|Metric for weighting and discarding algorithms in ensembles.
disc_thre_glo|-1|Ensembling|Global algorithms with score below this threshold are discarded. -1 = keep all.
disc_thre_reg|-1|Ensembling|Regional algorithms with score below this threshold are discarded. -1 = keep all.
###
### Nesting
###
n_levels|1|Nesting|CHECO26 单层口径（Global only），全部数据置于 glo（DATAPREP.md Single level usage）。
nesting_methods|covariate,multiply,multiplyw,average,averagew|Nesting|Methods for nesting global and regional models.
###
### Predicting and Projecting
###
glo_full_extent|FALSE|Predicting and Projecting|If n_levels = 2, predict global model over the full domain extent grid.
mask_pred_reg||Predicting and Projecting|Optional binary raster prediction mask in ./data/masks (regional).
mask_pred_glo|china_full.tif|Predicting and Projecting|CHECO26：全类群 v2 → china_full.tif（全域含岛）；切 fish 时改 mainland_china.tif。
do_proj|TRUE|Predicting and Projecting|If TRUE, performs projections under alternative scenarios.
proj_scenarios|ssp126,ssp245,ssp585|Predicting and Projecting|CHECO26 情景目录实况：scenario/<year>/<ssp>，ssp126/ssp245/ssp585。
proj_periods|2030|Predicting and Projecting|基线取 2030（bioclim 与 lulc 情景层唯一共同时期）；bioclim 另有 2055/2085、lulc 另有 2050/2100，跨主题时期对齐后再加。
###
### HPC Ressources（按集群队列实况调整）
###
pre_A_m|100G|HPC Ressources|Requested memory for pre_A step.
pre_A_t|00-00:15|HPC Ressources|Requested runtime for pre_A step.
pre_A_c|10|HPC Ressources|Requested CPU cores for pre_A step.
pre_A_p||HPC Ressources|Requested partition for pre_A step.
pre_B_m|10G|HPC Ressources|Requested memory for pre_B step.
pre_B_t|00-00:15|HPC Ressources|Requested runtime for pre_B step.
pre_B_c|1|HPC Ressources|Requested CPU cores for pre_B step.
pre_B_p||HPC Ressources|Requested partition for pre_B step.
