reg_B_t|00-00:15|HPC Ressources|Requested runtime for regional step (reg_B).
reg_B_c|10|HPC Ressources|Requested CPU cores for regional step (reg_B).
reg_B_p||HPC Ressources|Requested partition for regional step (reg_B).
reg_C_m|25G|HPC Ressources|Requested memory for regional step (reg_C).
reg_C_t|00-00:15|HPC Ressources|Requested runtime for regional step (reg_C).
reg_C_c|1|HPC Ressources|Requested CPU cores for regional step (reg_C).
reg_C_p||HPC Ressources|Requested partition for regional step (reg_C).
sce_A_m|80G|HPC Ressources|Requested memory for scenario step (sce_A).
sce_A_t|00-00:15|HPC Ressources|Requested runtime for scenario step (sce_A).
sce_A_c|10|HPC Ressources|Requested CPU cores for scenario step (sce_A).
